WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.765 --> 00:00:18.289
As they approached Columbus' three ships, Vinnie noticed a few sickly men.

2
00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:21.211
They were very thin and pale.

3
00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:25.095
One man had dark spots on his legs.

4
00:00:25.115 --> 00:00:28.838
"Julio," Vinnie whispered.

5
00:00:28.858 --> 00:00:31.500
"Those men look very ill."

6
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.521
Julio nodded sadly.

7
00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:38.142
"They have just gotten back from a long journey.

8
00:00:39.423 --> 00:00:40.303
They have scurvy."

9
00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:43.324
"Scurvy?" asked Vinnie.

10
00:00:43.344 --> 00:00:48.046
"It's a disease some sailors get," said Julio.

11
00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:52.908
"The ship's doctor thinks it's because sailors don't eat enough fruit."

12
00:00:52.928 --> 00:00:56.170
"But fruit is good for you!"

13
00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.171
exclaimed Mandy.

14
00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:01.032
Julio smiled at her.

15
00:01:02.252 --> 00:01:03.233
"You're right, Mandy.

16
00:01:04.593 --> 00:01:07.135
But, aboard ship, fruit rots very quickly.

17
00:01:08.476 --> 00:01:11.798
On long voyages, it's impossible to keep fruit fresh."

18
00:01:13.418 --> 00:01:15.880
Vinnie and Mandy looked at the sick men.

19
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.022
"That's sad," said Mandy.

20
00:01:21.583 --> 00:01:26.486
Suddenly, a high-pitched whistle blew and the pier buzzed with excitement.

21
00:01:26.506 --> 00:01:29.888
"Time to sail," said Julio.

22
00:01:31.204 --> 00:01:32.765
"But what about the book?"

23
00:01:33.365 --> 00:01:34.145
Mandy asked.

24
00:01:35.326 --> 00:01:36.646
Julio looked around.

25
00:01:37.907 --> 00:01:41.048
Sailors were rushing past him and boarding the ships.

26
00:01:41.068 --> 00:01:44.150
"Look!" he shouted.

27
00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.531
"There's Columbus on the Santa Maria.

28
00:01:48.412 --> 00:01:49.192
Come on!"

29
00:01:49.212 --> 00:01:54.014
Julio ran onto the ship, and the children followed.

30
00:01:55.595 --> 00:01:58.196
On deck, a man stood by the ship's rail.

31
00:01:59.508 --> 00:02:01.690
He was holding several sheets of paper.

32
00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:06.534
"Julio, get to your post," ordered the man.

33
00:02:06.554 --> 00:02:12.179
"Diego, these children must see Columbus," said Julio.

34
00:02:12.199 --> 00:02:14.601
"Can you take them to him?"

35
00:02:15.862 --> 00:02:18.264
Diego looked at the children impatiently.

36
00:02:18.284 --> 00:02:21.807
"He has no time for children," he said.

37
00:02:21.827 --> 00:02:23.348
"Go away."

38
00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.932
"Please," pleaded Julio.

39
00:02:29.384 --> 00:02:31.466
"It's important that they see the captain.

40
00:02:32.446 --> 00:02:35.889
This little girl found his book and wants to give it back to him."

41
00:02:35.909 --> 00:02:41.853
"Since you are Martin Alonzo's nephew, I will do as you ask," said Diego.

42
00:02:41.873 --> 00:02:44.595
"Good-bye, Vinnie and Mandy.

43
00:02:45.816 --> 00:02:48.557
It was nice meeting you," said Julio.

44
00:02:49.718 --> 00:02:53.201
He waved before running off to another part of the ship.

45
00:02:53.221 --> 00:02:55.963
"Thank you, Julio!"

46
00:02:56.663 --> 00:02:57.704
cried the children.

47
00:02:59.256 --> 00:03:02.658
"Come on, we're sailing in a few minutes," said Diego.

48
00:03:03.859 --> 00:03:06.961
He led them past sailors getting the ship ready.

49
00:03:06.981 --> 00:03:11.864
"I can't believe we're on the Santa Maria!"

50
00:03:12.344 --> 00:03:13.364
gasped Vinnie.

51
00:03:14.405 --> 00:03:16.146
He looked around excitedly.

52
00:03:17.527 --> 00:03:22.050
Mandy noticed some men carrying big sacks to an opening in the deck.

53
00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.012
A ladder led down into the cargo hold.

54
00:03:27.392 --> 00:03:30.734
With a loud crash, one of the men dropped a sack.

55
00:03:32.015 --> 00:03:34.977
Potatoes spilled out, all over the deck.

56
00:03:34.997 --> 00:03:36.758
"Watch out!"

57
00:03:37.218 --> 00:03:38.319
shouted Diego.

58
00:03:38.339 --> 00:03:40.780
"Grab those potatoes!"

59
00:03:42.881 --> 00:03:45.783
Everyone stopped to catch the rolling potatoes.

60
00:03:45.803 --> 00:03:48.425
"I got one!"

61
00:03:49.045 --> 00:03:49.926
Mandy shouted.

62
00:03:49.946 --> 00:03:58.175
"I'll get that one," Vinnie called, running after a potato that rolled a long way down the deck.

63
00:04:00.176 --> 00:04:03.078
Soon the potatoes were collected in the sack again.

64
00:04:04.339 --> 00:04:07.741
A young boy stepped forward and tied the sack tight.

65
00:04:09.142 --> 00:04:11.223
Mandy wiped her hands on her skirt.

66
00:04:11.243 --> 00:04:15.986
"That was fun," she said, laughing.

67
00:04:17.227 --> 00:04:18.128
Then she stopped.

68
00:04:18.148 --> 00:04:21.370
"Vinnie! The ship is moving!"

69
00:04:22.891 --> 00:04:26.085
Mandy looked around, but could not see her brother.

70
00:04:27.786 --> 00:04:30.627
Vinnie had disappeared into the crowd of sailors.

71
00:04:31.848 --> 00:04:35.370
The Santa Maria was pulling slowly away from the pier.

72
00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.471
"Oh no!

73
00:04:37.991 --> 00:04:39.472
What am I going to do?"

74
00:04:40.312 --> 00:04:41.533
she said to herself.
